@startuml 11-sequence-depart
' UML sequence diagram: a Départ, from choosing the car to sharing the sealed PDF (US-050 to US-058, US-044).
!include style.iuml
hide footbox
autonumber "<b>0."

actor "Staff" as staff
actor "Client" as client
participant "App\n(iPhone)" as app
participant "API +\nPostgreSQL" as api
participant "Storage" as st

== Vehicle, client, details · US-050 to US-052 ==
staff -> app : « Départ », car, renter (+ driver), dates, rates,\ndeductible, deposit, card (brand, last 4, expiry), typed amounts
app -> api : draft saved as it is typed
api --> app : car data, reference set, open damage, photo links (≤ 5 min)

== Departure condition · US-053 ==
staff -> app : km out, fuel out (pre-filled, adjustable)
opt dashboard photo, or damage found at the Départ (F-25)
  app -> api : ask for upload links
  app -> st : upload (new keys, insert-only)
  app -> api : damage record « constaté au départ »
end

== Preview · US-044, US-055 ==
staff -> app : recap complete, choose FR or EN
app -> api : preview
api -> api : check the car is free · contract « En attente de signature »\nreserve MCR-YYYY-NNNN (F-18) · render the PDF (Chromium)
api -> st : store the preview, SHA-256
api --> app : preview PDF
opt language switched, or the client disagrees (F-26, US-058)
  staff -> app : other language, new damage or photos, corrected values
  app -> api : new preview
  api -> st : store the new preview (same number); the old one is never signed
end

== Signature · US-054, US-057 ==
app -> client : full-screen signature pad
client -> app : draws once (F-17)
app -> api : drawing (PNG + strokes) · preview ID + SHA-256
activate api #F6EFDC
api -> api : check it is the current preview\nstamp the drawing in « Signature départ » on every page\nappend the signature certificate page\nPAdES seal, company certificate + timestamp
api -> st : store the sealed PDF and the drawing, with SHA-256
api -> api : one transaction (sign_departure):\nrevision 1 frozen + snapshot SHA-256 · inspection\nsignature evidence · contract active · car rented · audit
api --> app : signed · contract number
deactivate api

== Delivery · US-042 ==
app -> st : download the sealed PDF (presigned link)
app -> staff : iOS share sheet
note over app, st : Retries are idempotent: the same drawing for the same preview\nreturns the first result, never two contracts.
@enduml
